{"id": "ledgar/test/7367", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"The captions of articles and sections contained herein are for convenience only and do not limit or amplify the terms and conditions of this Lease.  Except as expressly provided in this Lease, the word “Term” will include the original Term and any extension, renewal or holdover of this Lease.  If more than one person or entity is named as Landlord or Tenant under this Lease and executes as such, then the words “Landlord” and “Tenant” are intended to refer to all such persons or entities, and the liability of such persons or entities will be joint and several.  The use in this Lease of a singular term includes the plural and use of the masculine, feminine or neuter genders includes all others.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Defined Terms\": null, \"Definitions\": null, \"Disability\": null, \"Disclosures\": null, \"Duties\": null, \"Effective Dates\": null, \"Effectiveness\": null, \"Employment\": null, \"Enforceability\": null, \"Enforcements\": null, \"Entire Agreements\": null, \"Erisa\": null, \"Existence\": null, \"Expenses\": null, \"Fees\": null, \"Financial Statements\": null, \"Forfeitures\": null, \"Furth